<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1361302/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361303" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center"><lb/>Doctissimo Viro <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_IMQW7IQZ" type="biblio">Contraresponsionem</rs> <abbr>D.</abbr> Comitis <rs key="pers_DE-588-109091766X" type="person">Jacobi Riccati</rs> pridem
      <lb/>a me missam Te accepisse confido Vir Celeberrime.
      <lb/><abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-109091766X" type="person">Riccatum</rs> problema a Te Geometris Italis proposi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tum haud soluisse scripsi. Nunc mitto pagellam<note type="comment">Mit dem mitgesandten Blatt ist wohl das <ref target="https://archive.org/details/s1id13301680/page/422/mode/2up"><hi rend="i">Avvertimento sovra il Problema proposto a’ Geometri d’Italia</hi></ref> im <hi rend="i">Giornale de’ letterati d’Italia</hi> XXI (1715), Art. XI, p. 422, gemeint. Das Beilagenblatt fehlt im Digitalisat des Briefs.</note> <rs type="biblio">Dia<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rio italico</rs> dudum (nimirum <add>paulo</add> post <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_IMQW7IQZ">contraresponsio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem</rs> <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-109091766X" type="person">Riccati</rs>) insertam; ex qua colliges plures Ita<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>los (si <rs type="keyword">Diarii</rs> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1037587715 pers_DE-588-119381842">Authoribus</rs>  credimus) tuum problema
      <lb/>faci<choice><orig><g ref="#ll">ƚ</g></orig><reg>ll</reg></choice>im<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> soluisse. Solutionem <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Hermanni</rs> nemini
      <lb/>profecto communicavi. Geometr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> qui problema solue<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re potuerunt fortasse, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ter <abbr>D.</abbr> Comitem <rs key="pers_DE-588-109091766X" type="person">Riccatum</rs>,
      <lb/>sunt <rs key="pers_DE-588-118937669" type="person">Guido Grandus</rs> Monachus Camaldulensis, <rs key="pers_DE-588-117541249" type="person">Ga<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>briel Manfredius</rs>, Marchio <rs key="pers_DE-588-117689610" type="person"><abbr>Johan.</abbr>Poleni</rs>, <rs key="pers_DE-588-104058412" type="person">Verzaglia</rs>,
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-117596027" type="person">Zendrinus</rs> <abbr>ec.</abbr> omnes etenim isti in vestris calculis ver<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sati sunt. Ea qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs> et Tu habebitis
      <lb/>animadvertenda super <rs key="biblio_IMQW7IQZ" type="biblio">contraresponsione</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-109091766X" type="person">Riccati</rs>, mit<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tere poteritis circa mensis <date when="1715-09">Septembris</date> dimidium ita ut
      <lb/>ea accipere possim sub Septembris finem, siquidem desi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deratis ut inserantur <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_3RJU6R8K">Diarii nostri Tomo</rs> vigesimo secun<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>do.
  </p>
  <p>
      <lb/>Problema hydrostaticum vobis propono, cuius solutio mihi
      <lb/>perutilis erit: quare Vos rogo etiam atque etiam ut mihi
      <lb/>faveatis.
      <fw type="catch" place="bottom right">Sint</fw>
  </p>
<pb facs="1361304" n="2"/>
  <p>
   <figure facs="../images/figures/1361304_01.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"/>
      <lb/>Sint duo canales duri cilindrici <formula>ADBC</formula>, <formula>MQOR</formula>, quom<unclear>o</unclear><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>docunque inclinati ad horizontem; semperque pleni
      <lb/>supponantur liquoribus cuiuscunque, densitatis, consisten<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ac gravitatis: eorundem canalium orificia sint cuius<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cunque figur<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> circularis, elliptic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, quadratic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, triangu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>laris <abbr>ec.</abbr> Determinare opportet liquorum fluentium
      <lb/>velocitates, sive celeritatum rationes, comparand<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sunt
      <lb/>quantitates liquorum dato tempore per extrema orifi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cia fluentium, determinandaque sunt tempora fluxus.
  </p>
  <closer>
      <lb/>Vale Vir Clarissime cum <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruo</rs> Tuo, cui salutem
      <lb/>plurimam mitto.<dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1715-08-31">Pridie Calendas Sep<lb break="no"/>
      <lb break="no"/>tembris MDCCXV</date></dateline>
  </closer>
  <postscript>
    <p>
        <lb/><abbr>P. S.</abbr>
        <lb/>Expressiones adhuc nonnullas <abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patrui</rs> Tui a me
        <lb/>non bene intellectas et in <rs key="biblio_I2Z37CBH" type="biblio"><choice><orig>d</orig><reg>D</reg></choice>issertatione de Motu
        <lb/>musculorum</rs> registratas, ut mihi explices rogo<supplied>.</supplied>
    </p>
<pb facs="1361306" n="3"/>
    <p>
        <lb/>Ait itaque <del>. Quoniam nunc</del><abbr>pag.</abbr> 6 linea 7. <hi rend="u">Quoniam
        <lb/>nunc <choice><abbr>ang.</abbr><expan>angulus</expan></choice> <formula>EAC =</formula> recto est.</hi>
    </p>
    <p>
        <lb/>Si per angulum <formula>EAC</formula> intelligit angulum comprehensum <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
        <lb/>radio <formula>AC</formula> et subtensa <formula>AE</formula> arcus <formula>AE</formula> angulus <formula>EAC</formula> non
        <lb/>potest <choice><orig><g ref="#esse">e&#x0360;e</g></orig><reg>esse</reg></choice> rectus: nam ducto per extremitatem semidiame<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tri <formula>AC</formula> arcus <formula>AEB</formula> angulus <formula>FAC</formula> non ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> <formula>EAC</formula> <choice><orig><g ref="#est">&#xE4E9;</g></orig><reg>est</reg></choice> rectus.
        <lb/>Qualem itaque angulum intelligit<abbr> D.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs> pro angulo
        <lb/><formula>EAC</formula> in sua <abbr>fig.</abbr> V <figure facs="../images/figures/1361308_01.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"/><note type="editorial">Die Nachzeichnung auf dem Beilagenblatt (p. 5) folgt <ref target="https://www.e-rara.ch/bau_1/content/zoom/5963324">Fig. V</ref> auf der Rückseite des Titelblatts der Basler Ausgabe von 1694. Michelotti zeichnet die Gerade AF ein. In der Druckfigur geht die Gerade zu F von B aus.</note> hic etiam <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me expressa? Supponit fort<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>asse pro exiguitate machinul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> muscularis <formula>BEAD</formula> arcum <formula>EA</formula>
        <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#esse">e&#x0360;e</g></orig><reg>esse</reg></choice> infinite parvum ita ut assumi possit pro Tangente?
    </p>
    <p>
        <lb/><hi rend="u">Hinc datis semilongitudine lateris machinul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> id est arcus <formula>AE</formula>
        <lb/>in partibus <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualibus 100000 et semiangulo dilatationis
        <lb/><formula>EAR</formula> inveniri potest sublevatio resistenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <formula>z</formula> qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
        <lb/>nempe est <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualis excessui quo arcus <formula>AEB</formula> superat suam
        <lb/>chordam <formula>AB</formula> <abbr>etc.</abbr></hi>
    </p>
    <p>
        <lb/>Cur sublevatio resistenti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <formula>z</formula> <choice><orig><g ref="#est">&#xE4E9;</g></orig><reg>est</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>qualis duplo excessui quo arcus
        <lb/><formula>AEB</formula> superat suam chordam <formula>AB</formula>?
    </p>
    <p>
        <lb/><abbr>Pag.</abbr> 7 linea, post Tabellam, quart<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice><note type="editorial">Das Zitat beginnt in Johann I Bernoullis <rs key="biblio_I2Z37CBH" type="biblio"><hi rend="i">Dissertatio inauguralis de motu musculorum</hi></rs> (Basel 1694), § 14, p. [16], in der vierten Zeile unter der Tabelle und setzt sich auf p. [17] fort.</note> pergit <abbr>Ingeniosiss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs>
        <quote><lb/><hi rend="u">H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c cum ita sint admiratio</hi> facile cessabit quam causari potest
        <lb/>experimentum illud quod teste <rs key="pers_DE-588-118771167" type="person">Wallisio</rs> <rs key="place_GEO-2640729" type="place">Oxoni<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> et <rs key="place_GEO-2643743" type="place">Londini</rs> insti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tutum fuerat cum inflata vesica bubula mediante qua flatus
        <lb/>spiritus humani per angustam fistulam ingredientis elevare
        <lb/>notabiliter poterat pondus 50, 60, 70 aut etiam plurium libra<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/><hi rend="u">rum pro viribus pulmonis flantis, adde et pro angustia fistul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>.</hi>
<pb facs="1361307" n="4"/>
    <p>
        <lb/>Experimentum hoc non solum facilius ex supradictis explicari
        <lb/>sed etiam longe exactius per principia nostra qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> et veram
        <lb/>vesic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> figuram et aeris elaterium quod ipsi proprium est sup<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ponunt ad calculum potest revocari quam fecit <rs key="pers_DE-588-117596027" type="person">Wallisius</rs>,
        <lb/>utpote qui commodioris sed minus exacti calculi gratia ge<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nuinam figuram sph<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>roidalem vesic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> inflat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ademit, in eius<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dem locum substituit rhombum solidum plane ut fecit <rs key="pers_DE-588-118659359" type="person">Bo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rellus</rs> cum suis machinulis; pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ter hoc etiam aeris elaterium
        <lb/><hi rend="u">non consideravit, quod tantum unice pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stat dilatationis offi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc></hi>
        <lb break="no"/>cium <abbr>ec.</abbr>
    </p>
    </quote>
    </p>
    <p><lb/>Crescentibus itaque viribus pulmonis inflantis et fistula an<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gustiore reddita crescunt elevationes ponderum, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> fieri
        <lb/>possunt <del>vesica</del> mediante vesica bubula flatu spiritus huma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ni per angustam fistulam ingredientis, inflat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>.
    </p>
    <p>
        <lb/>Demonstra mihi cur, quo fistula (per quam spiritus humanus
        <lb/>in vesicam ingreditur) est angustior, eo maior est ponderum
        <lb/>elevatio, c<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teris paribus.
    </p>
    <p>
        <lb/>Si experimentum illud a <rs key="pers_DE-588-117596027" type="person">Wallisio</rs> relatum ad calcu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lum per principia celeberrimi <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patrui</rs> Tui revocabis, mihique
        <lb/>calculum communicabis in perpetuum me Tibi devinxeris.
    </p>
    <p>
        <lb/>Si Celeberrimus <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs> aut Tu Vir <abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr> me recipere in
        <lb/>vestrum discipulum non dedignabimini, etsi procul a Vobis absim,
        <lb/>per litteras me docere poteritis, vobis proponam quolibet men<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>se aliqua problemata, aut nonnullas difficultates in rebus mathe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>maticis, aut physico-mathematicis, vobisque solvam expensas
        <lb/>pro <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517052105501">litteris</rs>, et pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terea quolibet mense nummum aureum <rs type="place" key="place_VER-frankr">Gallis</rs>
        <lb/>Louis d’Or dictum <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <rs type="person">Mercatoribus</rs> meo nomine persolvere
        <lb/>faciam. Mea negotia non permittunt ut ad Vos migrem. Rogo itaque
        <lb/>ut mihi faveatis.
    </p>
